{#- Day 15 after the due date. -#}
{% extends "email/base.j2" %}
{% block subject %}Second reminder — Invoice {{ invoice_number }} ({{ days_past_due }} days past due){% endblock %}
{% block content %}Dear {{ contact_name | default(customer_name, true) }},

Our records show invoice {{ invoice_number }} remains unpaid
{{ days_past_due }} days past its due date of {{ due_date }}. The
outstanding balance is {{ balance }}.

We request that payment be arranged within the next 7 days. If there is a
reason this invoice cannot be settled — a dispute, a missing document, or
payment details you need from us — please reply and we will resolve it
promptly.{% endblock %}
